``` Lab 11 - NTLM validation failures on the DC (4776). Workstation name is the source; spraying over SMB/NTLM shows up here. ```
index=wineventlog source="XmlWinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4776 Error_Code IN ("0xC000006A","0xC0000064")
| bin _time span=10m
| stats count as failures dc(Logon_Account) as distinct_accounts values(Logon_Account) as accounts by _time Source_Workstation
| where distinct_accounts >= 10
